	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Figure 1 lists missing baseline variables among the exclusions, supporting complete-case analysis, although detailed missing-data procedures were deferred to the online supplement. The main article states that missing-data handling and normalisation were performed but does not describe the exact normalisation method. The UNOS cohort was split 70:30, corresponding to 17,640 training and 7,560 internal test recipients; the final nomogram was additionally evaluated in 563 external-validation recipients. Graft failure occurred in 1,444 of 25,200 UNOS recipients, but no class weighting, resampling, or other explicit imbalance method was reported. Source code and trained model weights were not reported.

